<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that Iomega Corp was unavailable for trading after hours for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA and First USA Inc were also unavailable.</p>
</text>
